    <h2>Halving the footprint of an optical sensor module</h2>
    <div>
      <p>A customer brought us a working optical LiFi sensor module built around a machined metal housing and a flex-cable PCB. It performed, but it was large, slow to assemble, and expensive to build at volume.</p>
      <p>Through Hana's advantaged packaging team, we re-engineered the package from the optics outward resulting in a substantial improvement.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="lcs-lb">Development impact</p>
  <div class="lcs-impact">
    <div><span class="lb">Size (footprint)</span><div class="vl"><span class="ar">&darr;</span>50%</div><div class="nt">Smaller</div></div>
    <div><span class="lb">Thickness</span><div class="vl"><span class="ar">&darr;</span>30%</div><div class="nt">Thinner package</div></div>
    <div><span class="lb">Components</span><div class="vl"><span class="ar">&darr;</span>40%</div><div class="nt">Fewer components</div></div>
    <div><span class="lb">Assembly steps</span><div class="vl"><span class="ar">&darr;</span>60%</div><div class="nt">Simpler process</div></div>
    <div><span class="lb">Reliability</span><div class="vl vl--word"><span class="ar">&uarr;</span>Improved</div><div class="nt">Fewer interconnects</div></div>
    <div><span class="lb">Manufacturing cost</span><div class="vl vl--word"><span class="ar">&darr;</span>Lower</div><div class="nt">Per unit at volume</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="lcs-scroll"><div class="lcs-tl">
    <div class="lcs-stage">
      <div class="lcs-num">01</div>
      <h3 class="lcs-nm">Existing product</h3>
      <p class="lcs-bd">A legacy design with flex cable assembly.</p>
      <img class="lcs-fig" src="~/images/lifi-legacy-exploded.webp" alt="Exploded view of the legacy module: metal housing, optical window, flex cable PCB, VCSEL, ASIC, photo detector and passive components" width="992" height="1061"/>
      <p class="lcs-sec">Constraints</p>
      <ul class="lcs-lst">
        <li>Large footprint</li>
        <li>Flex cable required</li>
        <li>Complex assembly</li>
        <li>Higher manufacturing cost</li>
