    </div>
    <div class="lcs-stage lcs-stage--eng">
      <div class="lcs-num">02</div>
      <h3 class="lcs-nm">Hana's engineering development</h3>
      <p class="lcs-bd">We benchmarked the customer's design optically, electrically and mechanically, then rebuilt it for volume.</p>
      <img class="lcs-fig lcs-fig--proc" src="~/images/lifi-process.webp" alt="Six-step process: analyze customer design, optical simulation, mechanical optimization, PCB integration, package miniaturization, mass production design &mdash; from design to high volume production" width="912" height="1158"/>
    </div>
    <div class="lcs-stage">
      <div class="lcs-num">03</div>
      <h3 class="lcs-nm">New product design</h3>
      <p class="lcs-bd">A compact integrated LiFi light antenna module.</p>
      <img class="lcs-fig" src="~/images/lifi-module-new.webp" alt="The integrated module mounted directly to the board, with a one-piece metal shield and integrated optical window" width="1189" height="896"/>
      <p class="lcs-sec">Design</p>
      <ul class="lcs-lst lcs-lst--chk">
        <li>VCSEL, ASIC and photo detector integrated inside</li>
        <li>Integrated optical window and shield</li>
        <li>One-piece metal shield, EMI and ESD</li>
        <li>Direct board mounting, no flex cable</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
